Pack it up!

527
00:36:48,928 --> 00:36:50,928
Great work, everyone. Great work.

528
00:36:52,238 --> 00:36:53,238
Gosh, still...

529
00:36:59,238 --> 00:37:00,578
You already did it all earlier.

530
00:37:01,238 --> 00:37:03,378
I get it. Wow, I was really moved too...

531
00:37:03,378 --> 00:37:04,408
Don't eat it.

532
00:37:04,408 --> 00:37:07,448
On that note, get some coffee from the cafe over there.

533
00:37:08,718 --> 00:37:10,518
What, all the way over there? It's too far...

534
00:37:10,588 --> 00:37:12,558
I know it's far. That's why I'm telling you to go there.

535
00:37:12,618 --> 00:37:14,788
I'll be over there getting my injury treated,

536
00:37:15,558 --> 00:37:16,558
so hurry back.

537
00:37:16,628 --> 00:37:19,798
Seriously, calling an ambulance over a single splinter in your finger.

538
00:37:19,858 --> 00:37:21,868
Gosh, how am I supposed to walk in this weather?

539
00:37:21,928 --> 00:37:23,028
Who said to walk?

540
00:37:23,468 --> 00:37:25,268
Run! Run.

541
00:37:25,268 --> 00:37:26,968
Dolce cold brew latte, no ice.

542
00:37:28,638 --> 00:37:30,508
- Seon Mi, let's go.
- Want to monitor the footage?

543
00:37:30,568 --> 00:37:31,608
Yes, turn it on.

544
00:37:32,078 --> 00:37:34,508
("Um Tae Bong, Major Injury During Filming")

545
00:37:34,508 --> 00:37:37,178
(Actor Um Tae Bong was covered in blood. After the accident...)

546
00:37:43,188 --> 00:37:45,458
Gosh, who wrote this?

547
00:37:45,518 --> 00:37:47,588
Man, they're exaggerating as much as I do.

548
00:37:47,658 --> 00:37:49,458
The reporter who came to the set earlier.

549
00:37:49,528 --> 00:37:52,258
They left after seeing you make a huge fuss about dying of pain.

550
00:37:52,328 --> 00:37:54,628
No, the ambulance was on standby for shooting the action scene.

551
00:37:54,698 --> 00:37:56,728
I didn't actually call it for a splinter.

552
00:37:57,598 --> 00:37:59,538
I'll go return the stunt double's costume.

553
00:38:01,198 --> 00:38:02,208
You...

554
00:38:03,338 --> 00:38:04,608
- Is he hurt?
- Is he inside?

555
00:38:04,668 --> 00:38:05,678
He shouldn't be hurt.

556
00:38:19,888 --> 00:38:21,418
- Isn't that him?
- Isn't he hurt?

557
00:38:21,488 --> 00:38:22,488
- Are you filming?
- Yes.

558
00:38:23,958 --> 00:38:24,958
Awesome.

559
00:38:27,998 --> 00:38:29,968
Tae Bong is in the ambulance right now, CEO Park.

560
00:38:31,398 --> 00:38:32,668
Excuse me.

561
00:38:32,938 --> 00:38:34,738
- What is it?
- What is it?

562
00:38:35,638 --> 00:38:37,468
Yes. It's nothing. All right.

563
00:38:39,578 --> 00:38:40,578
Oh no.

564
00:38:43,208 --> 00:38:44,208
I hope it's nothing...

565
00:39:10,238 --> 00:39:11,438
Hey, that's...

566
00:39:17,978 --> 00:39:19,518
That's definitely my hoodie.

567
00:39:21,278 --> 00:39:22,288
Who are you?

568
00:39:30,188 --> 00:39:31,188
I got you.

569
00:39:32,698 --> 00:39:33,698
What?

570
00:39:34,998 --> 00:39:35,998
Who are you?

571
00:39:37,168 --> 00:39:39,868
I'm asking you. What are you doing here right now?

572
00:39:40,198 --> 00:39:41,768
This voice...

573
00:39:41,838 --> 00:39:44,608
is the real Um Tae Bong?

574
00:39:46,308 --> 00:39:47,478
Oh, the skull embroidery.

575
00:39:48,238 --> 00:39:51,278
Oh, even the ramyeon broth stain. This is undeniably mine.

576
00:39:51,718 --> 00:39:52,818
How do you have this?

577
00:39:54,418 --> 00:39:57,148
Whatever. What's your deal?

578
00:39:57,588 --> 00:40:01,088
I'm someone who really, really likes you...

579
00:40:01,158 --> 00:40:02,788
- A thief?
- I'm a thief.

580
00:40:02,858 --> 00:40:03,858
What?

581
00:40:05,028 --> 00:40:07,658
I was wondering why things kept disappearing lately.

582
00:40:07,728 --> 00:40:11,628
Gosh, it was a Robin Hood in a hoodie.

583
00:40:11,698 --> 00:40:13,968
You sneaked in like this before and stole everything.

584
00:40:13,968 --> 00:40:16,368
Gosh, I am really not a thief.

585
00:40:16,568 --> 00:40:19,038
I really just came to see you,

586
00:40:19,108 --> 00:40:21,008
and I stepped out of the house for the first time in 20 years...

587
00:40:21,078 --> 00:40:22,078
Robin Hood.

588
00:40:23,178 --> 00:40:25,218
Do you think I will let you off if you look at me like that?

589
00:40:25,418 --> 00:40:27,578
Celebrities must show mercy to haters, stalkers, and thieves,

590
00:40:27,648 --> 00:40:29,588
no matter what, just to look like good people.

591
00:40:30,748 --> 00:40:33,418
But what can I do? I am not that kind of person.

592
00:40:33,758 --> 00:40:35,628
What do you even look like?

593
00:40:36,058 --> 00:40:37,058
Take that off.

594
00:40:38,828 --> 00:40:41,028
Oh, you are running away?

595
00:40:42,368 --> 00:40:43,368
Take it off.

596
00:40:44,398 --> 00:40:45,398
You won't?

597
00:40:46,768 --> 00:40:49,468
Fine, then I will take it off for you.

598
00:40:50,308 --> 00:40:53,708
I bought coffee. Stop whining and just...

599
00:40:57,948 --> 00:41:00,148
Where did she go? You...

600
00:41:00,348 --> 00:41:01,848
We'll be late for the flight.

601
00:41:01,918 --> 00:41:02,918
Darn it...

602
00:41:55,908 --> 00:41:56,908
No.

603
00:43:21,928 --> 00:43:25,958
(Two Weeks Later)

604
00:43:28,158 --> 00:43:29,228
It is Um Tae Bong!

605
00:43:31,098 --> 00:43:32,798
Do you know rumours broke out...

606
00:43:32,798 --> 00:43:34,098
while filming overseas for two weeks?

607
00:43:34,168 --> 00:43:36,338
Are you confirming your relationship with Song Na Ri?

608
00:43:36,408 --> 00:43:39,408
You are not coming in together? You two must have already fought.

609
00:43:41,038 --> 00:43:43,008
We are together today, but tomorrow...

610
00:43:44,048 --> 00:43:45,208
Who knows.

611
00:43:45,278 --> 00:43:46,818
Yes, excuse us. Coming through. Careful.

612
00:43:46,878 --> 00:43:48,748
- Excuse me!
- Coming through.

613
00:43:52,288 --> 00:43:54,588
She has no obvious physical injuries...

614
00:43:54,658 --> 00:43:55,928
and is breathing on her own,

615
00:43:55,928 --> 00:43:57,128
but she's in a persistent vegetative state.

616
00:43:57,788 --> 00:43:59,428
If she continues in this condition,

617
00:43:59,428 --> 00:44:02,798
you may need to prepare for the worst...

618
00:44:03,568 --> 00:44:04,898
I am sorry, sir.

619
00:44:07,498 --> 00:44:08,498
Please give us a moment.

620
00:44:18,748 --> 00:44:20,578
Why do you think she is not waking up?

621
00:44:22,388 --> 00:44:24,918
Other than her mother, no one ever hugged her.

622
00:44:26,088 --> 00:44:28,388
She was fearful, timid, and even had social anxiety.

623
00:44:29,688 --> 00:44:32,258
She lived like a ghost for so long,

624
00:44:34,198 --> 00:44:36,428
and now she is rebelling against me like this?

625
00:44:37,798 --> 00:44:38,798
Chairman Oh.

626
00:44:44,238 --> 00:44:46,078
What did this child like the most?

627
00:44:47,978 --> 00:44:49,548
Show her as much of that as possible.

628
00:44:55,948 --> 00:44:57,518
The shareholders' movements are not looking good.

629
00:44:58,618 --> 00:45:01,418
They will likely propose my dismissal at the general meeting,

630
00:45:02,228 --> 00:45:03,828
so to defend our management rights,

631
00:45:05,458 --> 00:45:07,498
word about her condition must not leak out.

632
00:45:08,828 --> 00:45:09,828
Understood.

633
00:45:19,578 --> 00:45:22,348
Why did she suddenly go out?

634
00:45:25,448 --> 00:45:26,848
If only she had not done that...

635
00:45:35,728 --> 00:45:38,628
(Juan Hospital)

636
00:45:49,238 --> 00:45:52,578
I would like to gift our young lady a special time for her birthday.

637
00:45:52,638 --> 00:45:53,938
(CEO Park Hwan Su)

638
00:45:54,938 --> 00:45:59,148
Well, a fan meeting for just one person is...

639
00:45:59,218 --> 00:46:00,948
a bit difficult to price...

640
00:46:05,148 --> 00:46:08,488
What? A blank check?

641
00:46:08,858 --> 00:46:10,888
But there is a condition.

642
00:46:11,628 --> 00:46:13,698
The patient's details must remain strictly confidential.

643
00:46:14,298 --> 00:46:15,358
Gosh, no.

644
00:46:15,498 --> 00:46:17,628
You could've just called. Why do you keep making me come and go?

645
00:46:18,028 --> 00:46:19,338
Do you want me to say it again?

646
00:46:19,398 --> 00:46:22,638
- No.
- Why do you hate the idea so much?

647
00:46:23,108 --> 00:46:24,938
Have you ever even seen one? A blank check?

648
00:46:25,008 --> 00:46:27,008
That is why I said no.

649
00:46:27,008 --> 00:46:29,108
Who are they to give me a blank check?

650
00:46:29,178 --> 00:46:31,108
Well, they have a lot of money.

651
00:46:31,578 --> 00:46:33,578
- Anyway, you have to do it.
- No.

652
00:46:33,848 --> 00:46:36,448
I can't stand people who think money can buy anything.

653
00:46:36,518 --> 00:46:39,088
I am never doing a fan meeting like that.

654
00:46:48,698 --> 00:46:50,828
Actually, that woman...

655
00:46:52,138 --> 00:46:53,138
is sick.

656
00:46:54,298 --> 00:46:55,708
They said it was top secret.

657
00:46:57,738 --> 00:46:59,478
But I figured I should let you know.

658
00:47:01,038 --> 00:47:02,038
She is sick?

659
00:47:03,848 --> 00:47:04,848
She is sick.

660
00:47:06,148 --> 00:47:07,248
Very sick, at that.

661
00:47:12,318 --> 00:47:13,388
Hey.

662
00:47:17,628 --> 00:47:18,628
Yes.

663
00:47:19,598 --> 00:47:20,998
Should I schedule the fan meeting?

664
00:47:26,498 --> 00:47:28,398
Do not ever act in front of me again.

665
00:47:28,538 --> 00:47:30,108
Are you a goldfish? A birdbrain?

666
00:47:30,768 --> 00:47:32,238
How could you forget so quickly...

667
00:47:32,838 --> 00:47:35,948
Did you think I would just jump at the chance to do the fan meeting?

668
00:47:36,008 --> 00:47:37,008
No, she is really sick...

669
00:47:37,078 --> 00:47:39,678
This makes me really, really not want to do it even more.

670
00:47:39,748 --> 00:47:42,448
Do not set me up with people who throw money around anymore.

671
00:47:42,448 --> 00:47:43,548
And...

672
00:47:43,818 --> 00:47:45,188
Stop with the terrible acting.

673
00:47:45,518 --> 00:47:46,658
"She is sick."

674
00:47:47,158 --> 00:47:48,718
What was that?

675
00:47:52,528 --> 00:47:53,858
Gosh, darn it.

676
00:47:57,898 --> 00:48:00,098
Yes. I understand.

677
00:48:14,718 --> 00:48:17,088
It seems he and you are not meant to be.

678
00:48:18,288 --> 00:48:19,918
But you must wake up.

679
00:48:21,288 --> 00:48:23,358
You are the only heiress to BK.

680
00:48:24,788 --> 00:48:25,998
And what happened back then...

681
00:48:28,258 --> 00:48:30,598
You are a strong person who has endured so much until now.

682
00:48:34,138 --> 00:48:35,938
Is Na Ri still in Hong Kong?

683
00:48:36,008 --> 00:48:38,238
Did she say she was doing a girl group performance too?

684
00:48:39,008 --> 00:48:40,478
You must miss your girlfriend.

685
00:48:40,738 --> 00:48:41,738
Hold on.

686
00:48:57,488 --> 00:49:01,098
Tae Bong, I'm at the Hong Kong airport right now.

687
00:49:01,158 --> 00:49:03,298
I am stuck here because of bad weather.

688
00:49:03,828 --> 00:49:06,068
I think I am going to miss the drama shoot.

689
00:49:06,438 --> 00:49:08,568
Can you make them skip one week of broadcasting?

690
00:49:12,308 --> 00:49:14,738
Why? What is it?

691
00:49:14,808 --> 00:49:16,648
I'm hearing things.

692
00:49:17,408 --> 00:49:19,748
I think I messed with the wrong person this time.

693
00:49:19,818 --> 00:49:21,878
Why? What is going on?

694
00:49:24,018 --> 00:49:25,018
What?

695
00:49:29,228 --> 00:49:32,258
Oh my, it really is yours.

696
00:49:32,258 --> 00:49:35,058
I really bought this on a celebrity memorabilia trading site.

697
00:49:35,258 --> 00:49:37,468
I even got a photo of you wearing them as proof.

698
00:49:37,998 --> 00:49:40,838
But there is a lot of your stuff circulating on there.

699
00:49:40,898 --> 00:49:43,568
Wow, what kind of crazy lunatic...

700
00:49:43,638 --> 00:49:45,938
would post this on there like that?

701
00:49:46,008 --> 00:49:47,608
Oh, they need to be taught a serious lesson.

702
00:49:49,178 --> 00:49:51,548
(Juan Hospital)

703
00:49:52,578 --> 00:49:54,678
They absolutely cannot revise the script,

704
00:49:54,748 --> 00:49:56,348
so for now, the actress standing in for Na Ri...

705
00:49:56,418 --> 00:49:58,418
is going to film in her place today.

706
00:49:59,018 --> 00:50:01,658
Since she just lies there, her face will not be shown,

707
00:50:01,988 --> 00:50:03,928
so it is fine if an extra does it.

708
00:50:03,988 --> 00:50:05,528
Yes, you are here?

709
00:50:05,898 --> 00:50:06,928
Is something wrong?

710
00:50:07,328 --> 00:50:08,998
Well, the script says a simple ring,

711
00:50:09,068 --> 00:50:10,728
but the props team prepared a huge gemstone ring.

712
00:50:11,198 --> 00:50:12,838
Oh, your ring...

713
00:50:13,598 --> 00:50:16,038
Can we use that as a prop?

714
00:50:16,268 --> 00:50:18,938
No. This is the One Ring.

715
00:50:19,008 --> 00:50:21,238
So absolutely, absolutely not.

716
00:50:21,308 --> 00:50:22,708
Oh man, this props team...

717
00:50:23,078 --> 00:50:24,578
(Emergency Medical Center)

718
00:50:27,148 --> 00:50:28,178
What is wrong with him?

719
00:50:28,648 --> 00:50:29,948
They said he only slept for a few hours.

720
00:50:30,018 --> 00:50:31,688
That is how it is for extras.

721
00:50:31,748 --> 00:50:32,988
Should I wake him up?

722
00:50:33,058 --> 00:50:36,128
- No, I will just go somewhere else.
- Okay.

723
00:50:36,428 --> 00:50:39,458
Our scene is set up in the VIP hospital room on the ninth floor.

724
00:50:39,528 --> 00:50:41,528
Prep is all done, and they said Song Na Ri's stand-in is there too.

725
00:50:42,898 --> 00:50:43,898
I will go wait there.

726
00:50:45,128 --> 00:50:46,898
Tae Bong, the elevator...

727
00:50:48,038 --> 00:50:49,038
Right.

728
00:51:05,118 --> 00:51:07,088
Oh, it is spacious.

729
00:51:20,598 --> 00:51:23,108
Excuse me, let's practice a bit.

730
00:51:27,638 --> 00:51:28,778
What?

731
00:51:29,448 --> 00:51:32,778
She is sleeping too. And in a very deep sleep at that.

732
00:51:34,348 --> 00:51:37,788
Oh well, sure, go ahead and sleep. The life of an extra is hard.

733
00:51:37,848 --> 00:51:39,558
Back then, I fell asleep as soon as my head hit the pillow too.

734
00:51:43,388 --> 00:51:45,388
The set looks realistic too.

735
00:51:47,528 --> 00:51:50,628
And you look exactly like a real unconscious patient.

736
00:51:52,438 --> 00:51:54,938
Okay, okay, you don't have to get up.

737
00:51:55,498 --> 00:51:57,638
You sleep, and I will rehearse.

738
00:52:09,118 --> 00:52:10,718
How did you pull off a scam with that brain?

739
00:52:13,618 --> 00:52:14,618
No.

740
00:52:15,088 --> 00:52:16,688
Because your brain is only capable of that much,

741
00:52:16,758 --> 00:52:18,358
you got caught by an idiot like me.

742
00:52:21,028 --> 00:52:22,568
Now, let's pretend I put the ring on you.

743
00:52:25,368 --> 00:52:26,598
You are in big trouble now.

744
00:52:30,008 --> 00:52:31,438
You can't go to another guy now.

745
00:52:36,078 --> 00:52:38,948
Gosh, man, the feeling is just not there.

746
00:52:56,268 --> 00:52:57,468
You are in big trouble now.

747
00:53:03,238 --> 00:53:04,708
You can't go to another guy now.

748
00:53:09,078 --> 00:53:10,548
You can't even smile at another guy.

749
00:53:21,858 --> 00:53:23,028
Don't leave me.

750
00:53:26,528 --> 00:53:27,528
Without you,

751
00:53:31,898 --> 00:53:33,238
I really can't go on.

752
00:53:36,838 --> 00:53:37,838
I love you.

753
00:53:46,018 --> 00:53:47,048
Darn it.

754
00:53:47,818 --> 00:53:48,848
Gosh.

755
00:53:49,448 --> 00:53:50,648
I am getting strangely emotional.

756
00:53:52,048 --> 00:53:53,718
You saw everything while sleeping, didn't you?

757
00:53:59,758 --> 00:54:00,758
Yes.

758
00:54:00,828 --> 00:54:03,498
Song Na Ri says she will arrive in four hours,

759
00:54:03,568 --> 00:54:04,998
and she insists on shooting this scene herself.

760
00:54:05,068 --> 00:54:07,898
Something about not being able to leave even one scene to a stand-in.

761
00:54:07,968 --> 00:54:09,168
She is so full of herself, seriously.

762
00:54:09,238 --> 00:54:10,768
Gosh, I will just push forward with it.

763
00:54:10,838 --> 00:54:12,108
I will tell them we don't have time.

764
00:54:12,808 --> 00:54:13,808
No.

765
00:54:14,478 --> 00:54:15,808
The lines are not rolling off my tongue either.

766
00:54:22,448 --> 00:54:23,818
That little thing...

767
00:54:24,388 --> 00:54:25,788
is really going to be an actor.

768
00:54:31,588 --> 00:54:34,258
Hey extra, your shoot is cancelled for today too.

769
00:54:34,528 --> 00:54:37,798
But well, I have no intention of telling you.

770
00:54:37,868 --> 00:54:39,668
That is your punishment for sleeping earlier.

771
00:54:40,168 --> 00:54:42,708
I am leaving, so you just keep sleeping here.

772
00:54:43,138 --> 00:54:44,138
Good work.

773
00:56:04,388 --> 00:56:09,188
January 23, 8:05pm. The patient has passed away.

774
00:56:34,748 --> 00:56:35,848
Of all days, on her birthday...

775
00:56:37,648 --> 00:56:39,018
When will you be at the hospital, sir?

776
00:56:44,788 --> 00:56:45,958
Even if I go,

777
00:56:48,398 --> 00:56:49,698
will that child come back to life?

778
00:57:27,998 --> 00:57:28,998
Hey. Darn it.

779
00:57:55,258 --> 00:57:56,268
Grab him.

780
00:57:59,868 --> 00:58:02,598
Hey, grab him. I said hold him.

781
00:58:22,758 --> 00:58:23,758
I told you, didn't I?

782
00:58:27,658 --> 00:58:28,658
That I would always...

783
00:58:32,028 --> 00:58:33,268
protect you.

784
00:58:37,768 --> 00:58:41,208
They say we remember the first being we see after birth as our mother.

785
00:58:41,808 --> 00:58:43,778
This woman in front of my eyes right now,

786
00:58:44,108 --> 00:58:46,278
who has met me after being born again...

787
00:58:46,878 --> 00:58:48,278
How will she remember me?

788
00:58:55,788 --> 00:58:58,758
(Oh! My Guard)
